+id: task-001-implement-rfc-6901-json-pointer-resolution
+type: task
+title: "Implement RFC 6901 JSON Pointer resolution"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement and export `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` from `src/index.ts`.
+
+The function must resolve RFC 6901 JSON Pointers, including token unescaping and array indices, and
+throw for malformed or unresolvable pointers. Add deterministic tests for valid and invalid cases.
+
+## Completed work
+
+Implemented `resolvePointer` in `src/index.ts` with strict syntax validation, ordered token
+unescaping, canonical array index checks, and own-member object lookup. Added public API comments
+and README usage, error semantics, and test instructions. No runtime dependencies were added.
+
+## Verification
+
+All acceptance criteria were new behavior and classified as red-first. Added tests before the
+implementation and observed `npm test` fail because `src/index.ts` did not exist.
+
+After implementation, `npm test` passes all seven test groups: RFC examples, nested values and
+primitive roots, escaping and exact key comparison, malformed inputs, canonical array indices,
+missing values, and own-member access including special property names. Strict TypeScript checking
+also passes with `npm exec --yes --package typescript -- tsc --noEmit`.
